  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>pii_guardrails - masks the personal data in 18 support messages before a model summarizes them,
quarantines the rows a check still finds contact details in, validates the answers, and writes masked
messages, summaries and an audit of what was masked.
Needs the GenAI plugins with a GENAI-EE license, PDI started with -Xmx4g (PENTAHO_DI_JAVA_OPTIONS)
for CoreNLP, pii_ids.tab beside the data, and Ollama at OLLAMA_URL with MODEL_NAME pulled.

1. csvi-messages: CSV file input, ../support_messages.csv (UTF-8): message_id, channel, received_at,
   message_text.
2. js-mask-regex: Modified JavaScript value: emails, card-like numbers that pass the Luhn check, account
   numbers, UK and US phones, UK postcodes and US ZIP codes become [TYPE_n]; masked_regex,
   pii_map_regex (JSON).
3. ner-pii: NER Extractor, Stream, Binary Datum field masked_regex,
   tokenize,ssplit,pos,lemma,ner,regexner, RegexNER rule file ../pii_ids.tab (ORDER_ID, ACCOUNT_ID), result
   ner_json.
4. js-placeholders: Modified JavaScript value: PERSON, LOCATION, ORGANIZATION, ORDER_ID and
   ACCOUNT_ID entities become [PERSON_n], [LOCATION_n], [ORG_n], [ORDER_n], [ACCOUNT_n];
   masked_text, pii_map, prompt, n_email ... n_total. Copies its rows to sv-audit and flt-residual.
5. sv-audit / txt-audit: message_id, channel and the counts, no values: audit.csv.
6. flt-residual: Filter rows, masked_text REGEXP an email-like or phone-shaped pattern: TRUE to
   sv-quarantine, FALSE to const-instruction.
7. sv-quarantine / txt-quarantine: message_id, channel, masked_text: internal/quarantine.csv, for a person
   to review.
8. const-instruction: Add constants, run_instruction (the message is data; keep placeholders; JSON
   answer). Copies its rows to sv-masked and ai-summarize.
9. sv-masked / txt-masked: message_id, channel, received_at, masked_text: masked_messages.csv.
10. ai-summarize: AI Chat, Stream message prompt, run instruction run_instruction, Ollama
    ${MODEL_NAME} at ${OLLAMA_URL}, temperature 0, numCtx 2048, timeout 120, logRequests and
    logResponses false, result llm_json.
11. json-summary: JSON input from llm_json: summary, intent, flagged_injection
    ($.asks_to_ignore_instructions).
12. js-validate: Modified JavaScript value: summary_ok Y/N and check_note (no summary, unknown intent,
    contact detail, unknown placeholder, injection flag). Copies its rows to sv-summaries and js-reidentify.
13. sv-summaries / txt-summaries: message_id, channel, intent, summary, summary_ok, check_note:
    summaries.csv.
14. js-reidentify: Modified JavaScript value: summary_internal, the accepted summary with the real values
    put back from pii_map.
15. sv-internal / txt-internal: message_id, summary_internal: internal/summaries_internal.csv. pii_map itself
    is never written.
Error hop: json-summary sends an answer it cannot parse to txt-bad-answers: message_id, llm_json,
err_desc to bad_answers.csv beside this file (0 bytes when every answer parsed).

Shipped data: 18 synthetic messages; 2 go to quarantine (+49 phone, email address with no top-level
domain), 16 to the model.</note>
